<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in Nov 13 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in Nov 13 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED NOVEMBER 13</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............769,500 up.....2.400</p>
<p>Govt, agency securities...703,500 down...3,300</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......470,000 up.......800</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED NOVEMBER 13</p>
<p>U.S. commercial paper.....751,397 down...4,793</p>
<p> Financial companies.......567,272 down...3,504</p>
<p>New York business loans....42,565 down.....422</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......42,303 down.....423</p>
</text>
